  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> theo tính chất của hình lập phương.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình vuông nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊥̸</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Hay góc cần tìm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/5af4253d3a13ad5ee813d29c87e0edd3f790273a0dad5e52def8c35cb6954a9f.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure><div class=\"paragraph-gap\"></div></div>\n\t\t\tTam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là tam giác đều vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
